          "type": "bl_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"t4s-image-text-des t4-fs-md-15 t4s-fs-15 t4s-rte ebook-bottom-content\">\n  <h3 style=\"text-align: left;margin-bottom: 15px\">Together with the e-book, you’ll get our tips and discounts on Ahinsa shoes twice a month<\/h3>\n  <div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n    <p style='margin-bottom: 25px'>Our regular emails are already read by <strong>15,000 of&nbsp;you<\/strong>.<\/p>\n    <ul class=\"ebook-page-list\" style='margin-left: 25px'>\n      <li style='list-style-image: url(\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0522\/3428\/9312\/files\/check-mark_f256020c-d93b-4454-81b3-b0c741a29eb2.svg?v=1722981119\");'>\n        Tips for healthy feet and body\n      <\/li>\n      <li style='list-style-image: url(\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0522\/3428\/9312\/files\/check-mark_f256020c-d93b-4454-81b3-b0c741a29eb2.svg?v=1722981119\");'>Special offers and discounts on Ahinsa shoes<\/li>\n      <li style='list-style-image: url(\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0522\/3428\/9312\/files\/check-mark_f256020c-d93b-4454-81b3-b0c741a29eb2.svg?v=1722981119\");'>See the new models first<\/li>\n    <\/ul>\n  <\/div>\n  <a\n    href=\"#BlackBox\"\n    class=\"t4s-btn t4s-btn-base t4s-btn-style-default t4s-btn-size-extra-medium t4s-btn-color-dark t4s-btn-effect-fade\"\n    style=\"margin: 15px auto!important;\"\n  >\n    I WANT TO KNOW ABOUT THEM\n  <\/a>\n<\/div>",
