            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "The e-book was written for you by physiotherapist Lukáš Klimpera",
            "text": "<p>Lukáš Klimpera studied physiotherapy at Charles University, where he met <strong>Clara Lewitová<\/strong>. This prominent Czech physiotherapist inspired Lukáš with her vision of <strong>healthy and natural shoes<\/strong>.<\/p><p>After graduation, Lukáš worked at the <strong>LOGO clinic in Brno<\/strong>. And it was here that he found out what his patients needed. Exercise<br\/>often isn't enough – their feet need to be <strong>set free<\/strong>.<\/p><p>That's how Ahinsa shoes were created. Handmade vegan shoes that respect the shape of your feet.<\/p>",
